nonraid-tools (1.23.0-2) stable; urgency=medium

  * nonraid.service, nonraid-parity-check.{service,timer} and
    nonraid-notify.{service,timer}: stop relying on dh_installsystemd's
    generated maintainer-script snippets, which reload the BUILD HOST's
    systemd on an offline-root (DPKG_ROOT) install or removal. Install the
    units via debian/install and reload only from hand-written,
    DPKG_ROOT-guarded postinst/postrm.
  * libpve-storage-nonraid-perl now requires this revision: nonraid.service's
    ConditionPathExists only skips a FUTURE start on a host with the plugin
    installed, so an already-active nonraid.service from an older install
    keeps owning the array until this revision's coexistence fix is in
    place.

 -- Sveinbjörn Geirsson <sveinbjorn@sveinbjorn.dev>  Mon, 03 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

nonraid-tools (1.23.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Reconcile the Debian package version with tools/nmdctl (1.23.0).
  * Preserve the tools package as GPL-2.0-only.

 -- Matti Hiljanen <matti@hiljanen.com>  Mon, 03 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
